<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Sales of 63,900 MT were primarily the result of increases for unknown destinations (38,000 MT), Morocco (15,000 MT), and China (10,000 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 15,400 MT were to Morocco (15,000 MT) and Mexico (300 MT).</p>
</text>
